# Runtime

Not the product. Creates isolated game environments, sets env, spawns the Windows exe, collects logs.

- Backend binary is **injected by config**, not compiled in as "the app."
- Never require the user to run third-party config utilities.
- Persist shader/PSO caches outside throwaway dirs when possible.
- Crash = wrap backend logs in a Mogged report; never show raw engine traces in the UI.
- Do not vendor GPTK. Do not copy CrossOver.app into this tree.
